              <p>ProBrothers sits in a middle ground that most contractors never occupy — between the expensive high-end firms that price most homeowners out, and the budget options that cut corners you can't unsee.</p>
              <p>The company specializes in projects that require vision and customization. Cabinet alignment that's invisible. Trim joints that disappear into the wall. Spaces designed around how clients actually live — not around what's fastest or cheapest to build.</p>
              <p>The philosophy is simple: construction is craft, not a transaction.</p>
            </div>

