                <li>Poor communication — homeowners left wondering what's happening with their project</li>
                <li>Rushed workmanship that prioritizes speed over quality</li>
                <li>Transactional relationships where the client is an invoice, not a partner</li>
              </ul>
              <p>Daniil and Vitaliy built ProBrothers to be the company they wished existed when they were starting out in the trade. Every project gets designed around how clients actually use their homes — not around what's easiest to execute.</p>
            </div>

