              <p>From there, the team collaborates on design, offers transparent pricing with no hidden costs, and maintains ongoing communication throughout the project. Every trade — carpentry, cabinetry, trim, doors, windows — is handled in-house, with long-term partnerships with industry leaders for specialty materials.</p>
